        {
          "id": "gh-thalindra-1",
          "title": "The Grove Remembers",
          "text": "Grove-Mother Illa hears the grove wardens of the Wildwood restless since the Godwake: Thalindra walks again and weighs whether her children still keep the balance. Ask Sael what the old practices say, listen at the Wildwood without harming its wardens, cut back the carniflora that strangles it, and gather a living offering.",
